    "Ideal si pegaste un texto donde las palabras se atropellan o están en bloque.": "Vanya iâd tancatac tengwa saurë.",
    "Entrada:\n1girl bare shoulders\nblack shirt collared shirt\n\nSalida:\n1girl, bare shoulders, black shirt, collared shirt": "Minta:\n1girl bare shoulders\nblack shirt collared shirt\n\nEda:\n1girl, bare shoulders, black shirt, collared shirt",
